comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-08T11:42:58.003Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all statuses for PR 935, CodeRabbit review, runtime gates, pins, and source context; no canonical review-remediation item existed. This item consolidates all eleven findings from one paid feedback round."
  "2026-08-08T11:55:35.315Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: all eleven CodeRabbit findings were verified as valid. The local registry now supplies actual commands, arguments, environment, capture mode, and skip policy; skips emit status=skipped and ok=false. Runtime flags accept equals forms without re-scanning ambiguous values, lockfile parsing is package-entry bounded, upper/exclusion dependency ranges do not become floors, inherited source access fails closed, and snapshot resource exhaustion has its own public code. Focused suite passes 100/100 tests; lint, static quality, typecheck, generated contracts, and SDK surface checks pass."
  "2026-08-08T12:16:50.098Z","harness:codex","Full verification evidence: all 453 test files and 7,057 tests pass. Exact coverage is statements 50,225/50,225, branches 36,680/36,680, functions 10,319/10,319, and lines 48,630/48,630: 100/100/100/100 with zero uncovered counts."
  "2026-08-08T12:45:18.663Z","harness:codex","CodeRabbit exact-head follow-up validated: global value flags after the command left their values in mixed-command positionals, so schema --author alice add-type Bug could be classified as a read. The classifier now skips each global flag and its value after command resolution; focused SDK/CLI regression suite passes 76 tests."
  "2026-08-08T12:51:20.346Z","harness:codex","Exact-head f2e7775c1 hosted proof: every reported GitHub check is green, including four coverage shards plus the aggregate 100% coverage gate, static/typecheck/compat/smoke gates, Ubuntu/macOS/Windows runtime checks, CodeQL, Semgrep, Trivy, TruffleHog, ShellCheck, PSScriptAnalyzer, CodeFactor, DeepScan, Hound, Codecov patch, and CodSpeed. Fresh GraphQL inventory reports mergeable CLEAN and zero unresolved review threads. CodeRabbit and Sourcery reruns were requested but provider-limited/skipped; recorded as unavailable signals, not approvals."
